  WrittenDialogue: "So sorry to interrupt but I think somebody’s drowning!\nUgh bluh! Uno! Ugh-ruh!!\nI don’t have any lifeguard experience, do you?\nBut hey maybe you could help me take a couple more angles.  I want some full-body shots, they could go super viral.\nDo you have an iPhone by the way? I hear the cameras on those is good.\nUrghh save me! Uh-huck!!"
